id: pm-vcs-8y72
title: "Self-host bundle gate cannot pass on dependency-manifest-only changes, so every dependabot PR is red"
description: "All four open dependency-bump PRs (#34-#37) fail CI at accept:self-host since 2026-08-20: the committed selfhost.bundle tip tree no longer matches HEAD because package.json and package-lock.json changed, and only self-host:write can regenerate the bundle. Dependabot cannot run that step, so manifest-only branches can never go green. The bundle should version pm-vcs source, not git-owned dependency manifests; declare both manifests as excluded paths in self-host.json, regenerate the bundle once, and prove with a regression test that a manifest-only commit passes while real source drift still fails."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[3]: ci,dependabot,self-host
created_at: "2026-08-21T15:05:22.272Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-21T23:13:46.846Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-21T15:23:52.996Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-21T15:23:52.996Z"
claim_principal: ox-alpha
author: ox-alpha
acceptance_criteria: self-host.json excludes package.json and package-lock.json; the committed bundle is regenerated accordingly; a regression test proves a manifest-only commit passes while source drift still fails; full suite and coverage gates stay at exact 100/100/100
severity: high
resolution: "Dependency manifests are now declared exclusions of the self-host bundle; the regenerated bundle accepts manifest-only commits and still rejects source drift, proven by two new regression tests at exact 100/100/100 coverage."
expected_result: "A commit that changes only package.json or package-lock.json passes accept:self-host with no manual bundle regeneration, while any non-excluded source change still fails the gate."
actual_result: Every manifest-only branch fails at 'Prove the self-host bundle matches the committed source' with package.json/package-lock.json content diffs.
component: scripts/self-host
notes[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-21T15:23:13.747Z",ox-alpha,"Root cause confirmed: accept:self-host compares the committed bundle tip against committed HEAD; only --write regenerates the bundle, and dependabot cannot run it, so any package.json/package-lock.json bump fails CI forever (runs 32430648887/32430655960/32430668596/32430673978). Fix is data-driven: declare both manifests in self-host.json exclude; no gate code change."
  "2026-08-21T15:44:29.186Z",ox-alpha,"CodeRabbit review remediation: both new integration tests now isolate process.exitCode completely — capture the post-main value, restore the original in finally before assertions. Full gate re-run: 601/601 tests at exact 100/100/100."
  "2026-08-21T23:13:46.814Z","harness:ox-alpha","Merge evidence: merged PR #34 as 1779eb0, PR #35 as 0a92bde, PR #36 as 40d5832 (all squash-merged, checks green incl. accept:self-host on manifest-only branches). PR #37 (pm-changelog 2026.8.17) went CONFLICTING after the other merges; '@dependabot rebase' posted (comment 5376349878) and skipped. Daily Release cron 03:23 UTC will pick up the version bump; no manual publish."
files[2]{path,scope,note}:
