  "npm run accept:self-host",project,240,bundle tip byte-identical to committed source after final regeneration
close_reason: "Excluded package.json and package-lock.json from the self-host bundle via self-host.json, regenerated the bundle, and added two regression tests: a manifest-only commit now passes accept:self-host while real source drift still fails with the offending path named. Full gate: typecheck, lint (0 warnings), duplicates, docstring (153 declarations), coverage exact 100/100/100 with 601/601 tests. Dependabot PRs #34-#37 can go green once rebased."
